    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming we can achieve we target gross margin of 28% on this contract, we projected revenue over 4 years would need to be such that our projected revenue over the 4 years allows we to stay within the client's budget while meeting we own financial targets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total budget for this project is 3,000,000 euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate we potential revenue and margin, let's first determine if this project fits within we tender eligibility criteria. we maximum contract value eligible is 3,000,000 euros, which matches this project budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that we aim to achieve a gross margin of at least 28%, and considering The total budget for the project is 3,000,000 euros, we would need to ensure we costs are managed effectively to meet a gross margin of at least 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the cost breakdown for such a project in we context, we must consider we general financial health and capabilities. we annual revenue is 4,200,000 euros, with a net profit of 380,000 euros, indicating we have experience managing projects and generating revenue. we EBITDA margin (EBITDA/revenue) is approximately 14.5% (610,000 / 4,200,000), which gives we some insight into we operational efficiency but does not directly inform we project pricing strategy for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and guarantee the quality of service while aiming for a gross margin of 28%, we would need to carefully manage we fixed and variable costs. we cost sensitivity information indicates that 35% of project costs are fixed, and 65% are variable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This suggests flexibility in managing costs, particularly through renegotiation with subcontractors or scope adjustments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific project details, it's challenging to provide an exact projected margin on this contract. we would need to ensure we pricing aligns with we target gross margin while being competitive and within the client's budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of annual cost of exploitation, we must ensure that we ongoing costs fit within the local authority budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the total project budget and duration, the average annual expenditure would be 750,000 euros (3,000,000 / 4). we pricing model, including standard daily rates for various roles and infrastructure margins, would need to be applied in a way that balances we revenue goals with the client's cost constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, to provide a precise projected margin, we would require more detailed project scope information and a clearer understanding of the direct costs associated with delivering this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, we can affirm we interest in pursuing this project while emphasizing the need for careful financial planning to meet both we targets and the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must provide an intelligent assistance tool that can facilitate access to information, improve answer quality, and reduce processing time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must be able to contextualize answers in function of the demand of the agent and provide explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current AI capabilities meet these requirements, and what innovations can our propose? our current AI capabilities are centered around large language models, with expertise in deploying models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B. our have experience with fine-tuning methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain corpus, which can help improve the model's performance on specific tasks. our average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirements of providing an intelligent assistance tool that facilitates access to information, improves answer quality, and reduces processing time, our can leverage our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "RAG allows our to retrieve relevant information from a knowledge base and generate answers based on relevant information, which can help contextualize answers in function of the demand of the agent. our can also provide explainability and transparency by using techniques such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities have a typical retrieval precision at 5 of 0.87 and a typical answer relevance score of 0.84, which indicates that our can provide high-quality answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovations, our are currently researching knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, which could potentially be applied to improve the intelligent assistance tool's ability to understand the context of the agent's demand and provide more accurate answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our experience with quantization methods such as INT8, INT4 (GPTQ), and GGUF can help reduce the energy consumption of the model, making the model more sustainable and environmentally friendly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while our have capabilities that can meet some of the requirements, our will need to further fine-tune and adapt our models to the specific needs of the city of Belval's administrative services. our propose a collaborative approach to develop a customized solution that integrates our AI capabilities with the city of Belval's existing information systems and workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's policy is to limit the environmental footprint and comply with sustainable development principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we proposed solution meets sustainable development principles?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval's policy, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental capabilities, such as green hosting partners like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices also aim to reduce energy consumption, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our digital sobriety practices typically lead to a 35% reduction in energy consumption compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a carbon reporting capability based on the GRI Standards, which will help Nexus Engineering S.r.l. track and report Nexus Engineering S.r.l. progress towards reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By relying on these existing capabilities, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that our proposed solution contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact, aligning with The City of Belval's sustainability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval has a budget of 3,000,000 euros and a project duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our solution aims to improve the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users, while reducing the environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our propose a solution based on artificial intelligence and digital transformation, which will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must integrate with existing practices of the agents' and must not constitute a rupture in the agents' modes of work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must guarantee high-level availability, with a response time lower than 2 seconds, and provide explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must also contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.R.L., has expertise in AI solutions, public sector IT, and managing large-scale projects with budgets similar to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.R.L. have experience in designing intelligent assistance tools that can be integrated into existing systems of information, allowing agents to access reliable and up-to-date information quickly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our solution will be hosted on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent, ensuring particular attention to dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.R.L. guarantee strict compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) and ensure that data is not transferred outside the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.R.L. approach includes designing an intelligent assistance tool that can be integrated into the existing system of information, allowing agents to access reliable and up-to-date information quickly. an intelligent assistance tool that can be integrated into the existing system of information, allowing agents to access reliable and up-to-date information quickly will facilitate continuity of file processing between agents and services, enabling sharing of relevant information and effective resumption of processing by another agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.R.L. will also provide training for the agents' and ensure that Our solution is compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
