        ex:hasText "By following this approach, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can provide a comprehensive and coherent tender response that meets these requirements, ultimately delivering a successful project that improves the efficiency of administrative services and reduces environmental footprint." ;
