    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, with a response time lower than 2 seconds and 99.9% availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must integrate with existing practices of the agents' and the existing system of information, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical architecture meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have experience in AI/ML systems, Cloud architecture, API integration, Data engineering, and Cybersecurity. our can design a solution that integrates with existing practices and systems, including business software, civil status, town planning, EDM, and user directories, using our expertise in API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our technical expertise includes containerisation using Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm, which can help ensure high availability. our also have experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack, which can aid in achieving the required 99.9% availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding response time, our performance benchmarks indicate that our can achieve a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is close to but does not meet the requirement of a response time lower than 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our can explore optimisation techniques to improve a p95 response time of 1800 ms, which is close to but does not meet the requirement of a response time lower than 2 seconds further." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cloud infrastructure, our have experience with cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Azure (EU regions), which can provide the necessary scalability and reliability to support the required availability. our expertise in IaC tools like Terraform and Ansible can also help ensure efficient deployment and management of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while our current technical architecture can partially meet the requirements, our may need to conduct further analysis and optimisation to achieve the exact response time and availability targets specified." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

