        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure data protection through encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The data must not be transferred outside the European Union and must be hosted on SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent, without dependence on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we guarantee the security and compliance of The solution? we can guarantee the security and compliance of The solution by leveraging we existing certifications and experience in handling sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As an ISO 27001 certified company with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, we have a robust framework for managing information security risks. we GDPR posture is also well-established, with a Data Protection Officer appointed and standard data residency limited to the European Union. we have experience with anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models, which can be utilized if necessary to protect sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, we conduct regular Data Protection Impact Assessments, with an average duration of 3 weeks. we access control standards include multi-factor authentication enforced through methods like TOTP and hardware tokens, as well as role-based access control design experience and privileged access management solutions like CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data hosting, we experience with SecNumCloud-type infrastructure will enable we to ensure that the solution is hosted on compliant infrastructure without dependence on non-European suppliers. we also have experience with other regulatory frameworks such as RGS v2, EU AI Act, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS, which will help in ensuring overall compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By building on these existing capabilities and experiences, we can provide a secure and compliant solution that meets the client's requirements for data protection and regulatory adherence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract has a duration of 4 years and a global budget of 3,000,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the legal risks associated with The contract, and how can we ensure compliance with regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Counsel for we, I have identified several key aspects related to The contract duration, budget, and compliance with regulatory requirements. a duration of 4 years and a global budget of 3,000,000 euros are notable, but we primary concern is ensuring that we operate within the bounds of EU law and we own company policies. we must ensure that we subcontracting policy is respected, with a maximum of 40% of the work being subcontracted to EU-established entities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All subcontractors will undergo a thorough vetting process, including legal and financial due diligence as well as exclusion grounds checks. we standard contractual clauses include a termination for cause notice period of 30 days and a termination for convenience notice period of 90 days. we also have a price revision mechanism based on annual indexation capped at the official national index, with a maximum increase of 3% per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding intellectual property, we default model is work-for-hire, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment. we can provide source code escrow capability through Logitas in France and have an open-source licence audit process in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of liability and insurance, we have a limitation of liability set at 3,000,000 euros, professional indemnity coverage of 5,000,000 euros, and cyber liability coverage of 2,000,000 euros. we insurance provider is AXA XL, with policies valid until December 31, 2025. we are also aware of the need to comply with AI regulatory requirements, including the EU AI Act, and have expertise in this area." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we adhere to GDPR principles, with a standard legal basis under Article 6(1)(e) for performance of tasks in the public interest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate risks associated with The contract, I recommend that we carefully review we contractual obligations, ensure compliance with all relevant regulatory requirements, and maintain open communication channels with the local authority throughout the contract duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, we can minimize potential legal risks and ensure a successful partnership." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval has a budget of 3,000,000 euros for this project over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize we costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, and what is we projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The City of Belval budget for this project and we company context, to optimize costs while ensuring the quality of service, we should consider we pricing model and cost structure. we target gross margin percentage is 28%, and we minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

